<title>USA: CCC seeks 4,560 tonnes soymeal for Guatemala.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks 4,560 tonnes soymeal for Guatemala.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Agriculture Department said Wednesday it would accept offers until July 2 for 4,560 tonnes of soymeal for donation to Guatemala.</p>
<p>The soymeal is for July 17-31 shipment.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
